.claude/skills/plain-writing/LICENSE
.claude/skills/writing-great-skills/references/

# Prettier rewrites `*emphasis*` to `_emphasis_` and pads every table cell, and
# neither behaviour can be switched off. Running it over this repository's
# markdown produced 236 files of pure churn, so markdown is formatted by hand.
**/*.md

